This project incorporates data derived from the following sources:

1. 5e.tools / 5etools-mirror-3 (https://github.com/5etools-mirror-3/5etools-src)
   - Source data files: class features, subclass features, optional features (metamagic),
     spells, feats, items, monsters, and other D&D 5e content
   - License: MIT License (https://github.com/5etools-mirror-3/5etools-src/blob/main/LICENSE.md)
   - Attribution: "Data provided by 5e.tools (https://5e.tools) — MIT licensed via 5etools-mirror-3/5etools-src."
   - The 5e.tools project aggregates content from Wizards of the Coast publications
     (SRD 5.1, Player's Handbook, Xanathar's Guide, Tasha's Cauldron, etc.) and
     community contributions. This project uses their parsed JSON data files for
     feature descriptions, spell lists, and class/subclass definitions.

2. D&D 5e SRD 5.1 (System Reference Document)
   - Source: Wizards of the Coast LLC
   - License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
   - https://dnd.wizards.com/resources/systems-reference-document

