- greghcarr/dnd-srd-engine (https://github.com/greghcarr/dnd-srd-engine)
  * Event Sourcing, Plan/Commit/Apply/Replay cycle
  * Effect primitives and Derive layer
  * Branded ULID types for domain entities
  - Used as reference/inspiration only; no code directly copied.

